ata-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\)</span> 为本书实线文件定义的标准拓扑，不是另行任取的自由参数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Meager}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Meager}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d816c9cae96d1191\" href=\"?note=d816c9cae96d1191\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-meager.md\">../batch04/58-df-meager.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Add}:V\\rightharpoonup V\">\\(\\mathrm{Add}:V\\rightharpoonup V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a88cbf5f6d98949d\" href=\"?note=a88cbf5f6d98949d\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-additivity.md\">../batch06/58-df-additivity.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCiAdditivityMeagerNumber}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCiAdditivityMeagerNumber}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}additivity\\text{-}meager\\text{-}number} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCiAdditivityMeagerNumber}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal M=\\{A\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R):\\mathrm{Meager}(A,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\}\\land\n\\kappa=\\mathrm{Add}(\\mathcal M)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}additivity\\text{-}meager\\text{-}number} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCiAdditivityMeagerNumber}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal M=\\{A\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R):\\mathrm{Meager}(A,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\}\\land\n\\kappa=\\mathrm{Add}(\\mathcal M)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The meager ideal is bound inside the definition; it is not an untyped free parameter.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-additivity.md","status":"resolved","id":"a88cbf5f6d98949d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-additivity.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-meager.md","status":"resolved","id":"d816c9cae96d1191","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-meager.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-real-line.md","status":"resolved","id":"88bd8690da417bbc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-real-line.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-meager.md","status":"resolved","id":"d816c9cae96d1191","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Meager}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch04/58-df-meager.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-additivity.md","status":"resolved","id":"a88cbf5f6d98949d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Add}:V\\rightharpoonup V$ (see [[../batch06/58-df-additivity.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\mathbb R}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Meager}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Add}:V\\rightharpoonup V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCiAdditivityMeagerNumber}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}additivity\\text{-}meager\\text{-}number} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Zfc